  "hard_rules": [
    "search entity facts and query-relative candidate signals remain separate",
    "one immutable shard binds one exact universe and owner generation set",
    "no combined mutable global FTS corpus and no retained-generation rank leakage",
    "search core accepts exact shards and never resolves current or latest",
    "documents and fields are bounded typed origin-bearing projections and never full source bodies",
    "callers never provide raw FTS SQL regex callbacks plugins expressions or executable selectors",
    "explicit aliases are owner records and are never created from fuzzy text or popularity",
    "text fuzzy shape and graph signals are candidates and never lineage replacement migration impact intended-entity or platform authority",
    "graph expansion begins from exact candidates or caller seeds and paths never become direct edges",
    "canonical fusion uses integer fixed-point and ordinal features with stable exact tie keys",
    "raw FTS rank values remain shard-local and are never compared between corpora",
    "approximate signal repetition cannot cross exact authority bands or upgrade entity evidence",
    "every candidate exposes all contributions caps penalties skipped failed partial lanes and owner evidence",
    "approximate no-hit is never authoritative absence",
    "pagination and continuation bind exact retained shards requests profiles result manifests and cumulative budgets",
    "no model embedding CBM context service application source execution filesystem network process editor client or raw SQL behavior",
    "missing implementations FTS probes corpora benchmarks thresholds or checksums are blocking and never pass",
    "no Cargo Rust source or CI during documentation phase"
  ],
